Subject: [PATCH] Keep MCP import from planning replacement

Read cannot return hosted_config, external_config, or the registration-only
inputs, so imported state holds null for them and RequiresReplaceIfConfigured
plans a replacement for any configured value. The hand-written modifiers in
mcp_server_plan.go compare registration identity with the computed view
attributes and skip registration-only inputs on imported state.

--- a/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
+++ b/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
@@ -15,8 +15,6 @@
